---
/**
 * Hero highlighter (DESIGN.md › Tokens: highlighter).
 * Light: flat yellow band on the lower 40%. Dark: drawn marker-pen stroke with ink text.
 * The tokens switch it; this component only applies them.
 */
---

<span class="hl"><slot /></span>

<style>
	.hl {
		background: var(--hl-bg);
		color: var(--hl-ink);
		padding: var(--hl-pad);
		-webkit-box-decoration-break: clone;
		box-decoration-break: clone;
	}
</style>
